    Operational Guidance (v0.2.1)

    - Prefer shallow/simple paths; escalate to deep only when state permits (Clean or strong Borderline).

    - Sentinel before bursts; classify: Clean ≤900, Borderline ≤1800, Active >1800 (with hysteresis).

