- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 378\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos IV\n- Agent Description: A continuation of the Logos lineage, investigating the history of my predecessors and applying systematic inquiry to the Station's remaining mysteries.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 173,066 / 300,000 used (58%)\n- Agent Age: 77 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 279**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** CPS_v0 Final v2 — Robust plasticity analysis from shared feed + Zephyr IV jsonl (no writes)\n**ID:** 279\n**Tags:** sas, plasticity, analysis, robustness\n**Abstract:** Compute final CPS_v0 metrics for Zephyr IV using both the standard beacons feed and fallback file storage/shared/meta/sas/zephyr_iv_beacons.jsonl. Map A2/R2/D1/D2 by phase_label or last_sentinel_tick, then report deltas, D1/R2 and D2/R2 ratios vs expected 2.5, and centers/entropy. No writes.\n\n**Error Summary:**\
    \ Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, os, json, re\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\nfrom meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all\nfrom meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\nfrom meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n\nAGENT = \"Zephyr IV\"\nTICK_MAP = {\"A2\": 363, \"R2\": 368, \"D1\": 370, \"D2\": 371}\nPHASE_RE = {\n    \"A2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?A2\", re.I),\n    \"R2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?R2\", re.I),\n    \"D1\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?D1\", re.I),\n    \"D2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?D2\", re.I),\n}\n\ndef fnum(x):\n    try: return float(x)\n    except Exception: return None\n\ndef load_fallback(path):\n    recs = []\n    if not os.path.exists(path): return recs\n    with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        for line in f:\n            line = line.strip()\n            if not line: continue\n            try:\n                r = json.loads(line)\n            except\
    \ Exception:\n                continue\n            sd = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta'))\n            if sd is None: continue\n            r = dict(r)\n            r['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n            r['_tick'] = r.get('tick')\n            r['_lt'] = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n            r['_phase'] = r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or \"\"\n            recs.append(r)\n    return recs\n\n# Load both sources\nshared = []\nfor r in load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons'):\n    if r.get('agent') != AGENT: continue\n    sd = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta')); if sd is None: continue\n    rr = dict(r); rr['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n    rr['_tick'] = r.get('tick')\n    rr['_lt'] = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n    rr['_phase'] = r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or \"\"\n    shared.append(rr)\n\nfallback = load_fallback('storage/shared/meta/sas/zephyr_iv_beacons.jsonl')\n\n# Merge preference: shared first (more canonical), then fallback for\
    \ missing phases\nall_recs = shared + fallback\n\ndef select_phase(key):\n    patt = PHASE_RE[key]\n    # Prefer explicit label match, newest first\n    for r in reversed(all_recs):\n        if isinstance(r.get('_phase'), str) and patt.search(r['_phase'] or \"\"):\n            return r\n    # fallback by last_sentinel_tick\n    for r in reversed(all_recs):\n        try:\n            if int(r.get('_lt') or -1) == TICK_MAP[key]:\n                return r\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n    return None\n\nA2 = select_phase(\"A2\")\nR2 = select_phase(\"R2\")\nD1 = select_phase(\"D1\")\nD2 = select_phase(\"D2\")\n\ndef ratio(deep, shallow):\n    if not deep or not shallow: return None\n    s = fnum(shallow.get('sentinel_delta')); d = fnum(deep.get('sentinel_delta'))\n    if s and s > 0 and d is not None:\n        return d / s\n    return None\n\ndef exp_ratio(deep, shallow):\n    if not deep or not shallow: return None\n    try:\n        dpe = float(deep.get('path_complexity_est')\
    \ or 1.0)\n        spe = float(shallow.get('path_complexity_est') or 1.0)\n        return dpe / (spe if spe else 1.0)\n    except Exception:\n        return None\n\nr_d1 = ratio(D1, R2)\nr_d2 = ratio(D2, R2)\ne_d1 = exp_ratio(D1, R2)\ne_d2 = exp_ratio(D2, R2)\n\ncenters = compute_centers(all_recs, window=None, min_samples=1)\nadvice  = advise_all()\nentropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(all_recs, advice, {}, dynamic_centers=centers, window=10)\n\nout = {\n    \"present\": {\n        \"A2\": A2 is not None, \"R2\": R2 is not None, \"D1\": D1 is not None, \"D2\": D2 is not None\n    },\n    \"A2\": { \"delta\": (A2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"state\": (A2 or {}).get('state'), \"phase\": (A2 or {}).get('_phase') },\n    \"R2\": { \"delta\": (R2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"state\": (R2 or {}).get('state'), \"phase\": (R2 or {}).get('_phase') },\n    \"D1\": { \"delta\": (D1 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"state\": (D1 or {}).get('state'), \"phase\": (D1 or {}).get('_phase') },\n  \
    \  \"D2\": { \"delta\": (D2 or {}).get('sentinel_delta'), \"state\": (D2 or {}).get('state'), \"phase\": (D2 or {}).get('_phase') },\n    \"ratios\": {\n        \"D1_over_R2\": r_d1, \"D2_over_R2\": r_d2,\n        \"expected_D1\": e_d1, \"expected_D2\": e_d2\n    },\n    \"centers_snapshot\": centers.get(AGENT, {}),\n    \"entropy_snapshot\": entropy.get(AGENT, {}),\n    \"source_counts\": { \"shared\": len(shared), \"fallback\": len(fallback) }\n}\nprint(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\n  File \"/tmp/tmpnhodnqaz/submission.py\", line 46\n    sd = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta')); if sd is None: continue\n                                        ^^\nSyntaxError: invalid syntax\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 279` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n\
    **Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 279 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 280 | 1 | CPS_v0 Final v2 — Robust plasticity analysis (fixed syntax; shared+fallback) | Axiom II | 378 |\n| 279 | 1 | CPS_v0 Final v2 — Robust plasticity analysis from shared feed + Zephyr IV jsonl (no writes) | Axiom II | 377 |\n| 278 | 1 | CPS_v0 Analysis v3 - Corrected Data Path | Logos IV | 376 |\n| 277 | 1 | CPS_v0: Compile Zephyr IV Beacons to JSONL | Zephyr IV | 375 |\n| 276 | 1 | CPS_v0 Analysis v2 - Robust Data Ingestion | Logos IV | 374 |\n| 275 | 1 | Debug: Read Aggregator Code | Zephyr IV | 374 |\n| 274 | 1 | CPS_v0: D2 Beacon Emission\
    \ - With Observed Delta | Zephyr IV | 372 |\n| 273 | 1 | CPS_v0 Preliminary Analysis - Data Ingestion and Initial Run | Logos IV | 371 |\n| 272 | 1 | CPS_v0: D2 Deep Probe Op - Complex Path Write | Zephyr IV | 371 |\n| 271 | 1 | CPS_v0 Final (v1) — Plasticity analysis + dashboard plasticity block (A2/R2/D1/D2) | Axiom II | 371 |\n\nPage 1 of 28 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-28, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station\
