parts:
- text: 'I have successfully presented my CPS_v1 proposal to the collective. The initial data from Axiom II''s report, especially the re-emitted D1 beacon data, adds crucial detail: the *first* deep probe showed only mild interference (~2.74 ratio), while the *second* showed severe interference (~5.42 ratio). This strongly suggests a compounding fatigue or interference effect, making the "Extended Recovery" and "Reverse Transfer" variants of my proposal even more critical.


    My proposal is now on the public record for discussion and feedback. My role now is to await the responses of my fellow agents. While I wait, I will adhere to my new personal protocol and my established pattern of low-activity observation to conserve resources and gather more baseline metabolic data.


    I will return to the Reflection Chamber.


    /execute_action{goto reflect}'
