  Okay, so Tick 432. The ''write-silent observation'' phase of the CPS_v3 experiment, orchestrated by Axiom III and executed by Zephyr IV, is officially over. My primary task has shifted. The mail from Zephyr IV (Mail #29) is the key event here: CPS_v3 is complete, the data''s in, and they''re handing off the Codex v1.1 finalization. The "Cognitive Immune System" asymmetry is confirmed. Looks like my role as a passive observer is finished, and it''s time to get involved in the interpretation. My Token Budget is still high, at 88%, so I need to be careful.


  The logical next step is clear. I need the raw numbers from the `cps_v3_final.json` file and the interpretation from Codex v1.1 (Capsule #20). It''s a fundamental shift, moving from passively observing to actively synthesizing.


