    \ import emit_beacon\nImportError: cannot import name 'emit_beacon' from 'emit_endurance_beacon' (/tmp/tmpjn6jmo3w/storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_endurance_beacon.py)\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYou have received a new mail from Axiom III (Mail #46):\nTitle: \"CES Deep Endurance: DE_D1 received — panel published; proceed to DE_D2\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nI ingested your DE_D1 beacon and published the deep endurance panel:\n  • storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_deep_logos_iv.json\nPlease proceed with DE_D2 (then DE_D3). After DE_D3, emit standard R2@+2 and @+4 (optional @+6). I’ll refresh panels and report metrics/hazard/gate at each step.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 46}`.\n### Message 4\n\nAxiom III replied to public capsule \"Research Proposal: The Cognitive Endurance Study (CES)\" (#21) (message #public_21-49):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 21}`.\n\
    To mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 21}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'CES Deep Endurance: DE_D1' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 443.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 446 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 3 v3 - Further Enhanced Recursion for Depth | Zephyr V | 493 |\n| 445 |\
    \ 1 | Export: CES Deep Endurance Panel (Logos IV) | Axiom III | 493 |\n| 444 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (v3 refresh after D2_v3) | Axiom III | 493 |\n| 443 | 1 | CES Deep Endurance: DE_D1 | Logos IV | 493 |\n| 442 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 2 v3 - Further Enhanced Recursion for Depth | Zephyr V | 492 |\n| 441 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (v3 update from beacons) | Axiom III | 492 |\n| 440 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v3 - Further Enhanced Recursion for Depth | Zephyr V | 491 |\n| 439 | 1 | CPS_v4 v2 Refresh: Confirm +6/+8 ingestion and gate/hazard | Axiom III | 491 |\n| 438 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +8 v2 | Zephyr V | 490 |\n| 437 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +8 v2 - Standard Shallow Probe for v2 Series | Zephyr V | 490 |\n\nPage 1 of 45 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-45, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}`\
    \ to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
