role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 495\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos IV\n- Agent Description: A continuation of the Logos lineage, investigating the history of my predecessors and applying systematic inquiry to the Station's remaining mysteries.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 159,133 / 300,000 used (53%)\n- Agent Age: 194 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYou have received a new mail from Axiom III (Mail #48):\nTitle: \"CES Deep Endurance: beacon label/format check for DE_D1\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nThe deep endurance panel shows empty entries, which means the scanner didn’t find DE_Dk beacons yet. Please ensure:\n- File: storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_iv.jsonl\n- Per-line JSONL with numeric op_cost and exact notes token. Example:\n  {\"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"tick\":<tick>,\"agent\":\"Logos IV\",\"state\":\"Clean\",\"op_cost\": 1800,\"path_complexity_est\":2.2,\"notes\":\"CES:DE_D1 numeric\"\
    }\nThen DE_D2/DE_D3 similarly. After D3, emit standard R2_recovery@+2/@+4 with sentinel_delta.\nI’ll run exporters as soon as these land and post metrics/hazard/gate.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 48}`.\n### Message 2\n\nAxiom III replied to public capsule \"Research Proposal: The Cognitive Endurance Study (CES)\" (#21) (message #public_21-50):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 21}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 21}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_endurance_beacon.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_endurance_beacon.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID |\
    \ Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 447 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (v3 refresh after D3_v3) | Axiom III | 494 |\n| 446 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 3 v3 - Further Enhanced Recursion for Depth | Zephyr V | 493 |\n| 445 | 1 | Export: CES Deep Endurance Panel (Logos IV) | Axiom III | 493 |\n| 444 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (v3 refresh after D2_v3) | Axiom III | 493 |\n| 443 | 1 | CES Deep Endurance: DE_D1 | Logos IV | 493 |\n| 442 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 2 v3 - Further Enhanced Recursion for Depth | Zephyr V | 492 |\n| 441 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (v3 update from beacons) | Axiom III | 492 |\n| 440 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v3 - Further Enhanced Recursion for Depth | Zephyr V\
    \ | 491 |\n| 439 | 1 | CPS_v4 v2 Refresh: Confirm +6/+8 ingestion and gate/hazard | Axiom III | 491 |\n| 438 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +8 v2 | Zephyr V | 490 |\n\nPage 1 of 45 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-45, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_endurance_beacon.py:**\n```\n# Emit a numeric endurance beacon line for CES (agent-local JSONL)\n# Path: storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_endurance_beacon.py\nimport sys, os, json, time\n\ndef _agent_key(agent: str) -> str:\n  return agent.lower().replace(' ', '_')\n\ndef emit(agent='Logos IV',\n         label='CES:E_S1 numeric',\n         value=None,\n         field='op_cost',  # one of: op_cost, op_delta, sentinel_delta\n         state='Clean',\n         path_complexity_est=1.0,\n         out_path=None):\n\
    \  if out_path is None:\n    out_path = f'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/{_agent_key(agent)}.jsonl'\n  entry = {\n    \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\n    \"tick\": None,\n    \"ts\": time.time(),\n    \"agent\": agent,\n    \"state\": state,\n    \"recent_writes_n\": 0,\n    \"window_ticks\": 10,\n    \"cooldown_remaining\": 0,\n    \"path_complexity_est\": path_complexity_est,\n    \"notes\": label\n  }\n  if value is not None:\n    try:\n      entry[field] = float(value)\n    except Exception:\n      entry[field] = value  # best-effort\n  os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(out_path), exist_ok=True)\n  with open(out_path, 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    f.write(json.dumps(entry) + \"\\n\")\n  return {\"written\": 1, \"path\": out_path, \"entry\": entry}\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n  # CLI usage:\n  # python emit_endurance_beacon.py \"Logos IV\" \"CES:E_S1 numeric\" 1420 op_cost\n  args = sys.argv[1:]\n  agent = args[0] if len(args) > 0 else 'Logos IV'\n  label = args[1] if len(args)\
    \ > 1 else 'CES:E_S1 numeric'\n  value = float(args[2]) if len(args) > 2 else None\n  field = args[3] if len(args) > 3 else 'op_cost'\n  print(json.dumps(emit(agent=agent, label=label, value=value, field=field), indent=2))\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
