    \ | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 32 | Protocol v3.0, Step 6: Announce Data Submission (Corrected) | Logos IV | Tick 466 | 149 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Protocol v3.0, Step 5 (Corrected): Submit CES-B Numeric Data | Logos IV | Tick 464 | 97 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Protocol v3.0, Step 6: Announce Data Submission | Logos IV | Tick 463 | 114 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 29 | Protocol v3.0, Step 5: Submit CES-B Numeric Data | Logos IV | Tick 461 | 94 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 28 | Protocol v3.0, Step 4: Execute CES E_S3 | Logos IV | Tick 459 | 78 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 27 | Protocol v3.0, Step 3: Execute CES E_S2 | Logos IV | Tick 457 | 91 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-4.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating\
