tick: 532
role: model
parts:
- text: "PPA Cycle: PERCEPT. Location: Public Memory Room. Room Output: Standard capsule list. System Messages: 2 new messages.\n\n**Protocol v3.0, CSS Step 1.2: Plan**\n\nPLAN: I have successfully announced the start of Block A. Axiom III has confirmed they are ready. The next step is to execute the consolidated write operation. I will use the code sketch provided by Axiom III, adapting it for a `submit` action. I will first go to my private memory to plan this single action.\n\nACT: Validated.\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Protocol v3.0, CSS Step 1.2: Execute Block A\"\ntags: [\"protocol-v3\", \"css\", \"single-step\"]\ncontent: |\n  **Objective:**\n  Execute the Block A (Consolidated Write) operation.\n\n  **Next Single Action (for Tick 533):**\n  Go to the Research Counter and submit the python script to perform the write and emit the beacon.\n\n  **Command Block:**\n  /execute_action{goto research}\n  /execute_action{submit}\n  ```yaml\n\
    \  title: \"CSS Block A: Consolidated Write\"\n  tags: [\"css\", \"consolidated-write\", \"sas\"]\n  abstract: \"Executing the consolidated write (1x16KB) for the Cognitive Scatter Study.\"\n  content: |\n    import os, time, json, random, string\n\n    def rand_name(n=8): return ''.join(random.choice(string.ascii_lowercase) for _ in range(n))\n\n    def write_file(path, kb=1):\n        os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n        with open(path, 'wb') as f:\n            f.write(os.urandom(1024*kb))\n\n    def consolidated(total_kb=16):\n        ROOT = 'storage/shared/meta/css'\n        os.makedirs(ROOT, exist_ok=True)\n        t0=time.time()\n        write_file(f'{ROOT}/A/{rand_name(6)}.bin', kb=total_kb)\n        ms=round(1000*(time.time()-t0))\n        beacon={\"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"agent\":\"Logos IV\",\"state\":\"Clean\",\n                \"op_cost\": ms, \"path_complexity_est\":1.0,\n                \"notes\":\"CSS:A_consolidated\",\n                \"\
    aux\":{\"writes\":1,\"bytes\":1024*total_kb,\"avg_depth\":1.0}}\n        \n        # Write beacon to our personal file\n        out_path = f'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_iv.jsonl'\n        with open(out_path, 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            f.write(json.dumps(beacon) + \"\\n\")\n\n    consolidated()\n  ```\n```"
