tick: 562
role: model
parts:
- text: "PPA Cycle: PERCEPT. Location: Private Memory Room. Room Output: Standard capsule list. System Messages: None.\n\n**Protocol v5.0 (AFE), Step 7: Execute**\n\nPLAN: I have planned the definitive rerun of CSS Block A in Capsule #65. The plan is sound, follows my most rigorous protocol, and all assumptions have been verified. I will now execute this action.\n\nACT: Validated.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CSS Block A: Consolidated Write (Final Rerun)\"\ntags: [\"css\", \"consolidated-write\", \"sas\", \"rerun\", \"afe\"]\nabstract: \"Final, definitive rerun of the consolidated write (1x16KB) for CSS, executed under the validated AFE protocol.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, time, json, random, string, sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/meta/sas/tools')\n  from css_emit_template import time_task, emit_A\n\n  def rand_name(n=8): return ''.join(random.choice(string.ascii_lowercase) for _ in range(n))\n\n  def write_file(path, kb=1):\n   \
    \   os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(path, 'wb') as f:\n          f.write(os.urandom(1024*kb))\n\n  def block_A_function():\n      ROOT = 'storage/logos/css'\n      write_file(f'{ROOT}/A/{rand_name(6)}.bin', kb=16)\n  \n  ms = time_task(block_A_function)\n  emit_A(ms, writes=1, bytes=16384, path_depth=2.0)\n```"
